  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūng'witana Sang'weli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nyanda ū Sang'weli watūmamaga kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Eli, alīyo ū mu shikū jenījo ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gwalī nambu; gwalī gūtoolechiagwa hingī ū kū banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò būjikū ū namhala Eli walī alaalile aho walaalaga na kale; ī tala ya ng'wa SEEBA yabakaga, yalī ītaalī ū kūjimiwa, gwike ū mu shikū jenījo a miso gakwe gakasangwa gandya kūdeda, ooya ū kūbona chiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli nang'hwe walī walaala ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūko lyalī ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū SEEBA wang'witana ū Sang'weli; nang'hwe ū Sang'weli widīka ūshosha, “Kalame nalīho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūpeela ajile ū kūlī namhala Eli ūūkang'wīla, “Nalīho baba wanitana.” Ū Eli ūhaya, “Mm yaya natitanile ū nene, shokaga dūhū ūkalaale.” Ūshoka ng'hana ūūkalaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA witana hangī, “Sang'weli!” Ū Sang'weli ūbūūka ūja ū kūlī Eli ūūkang'wīla, “Naashika baba wanitana.” Ū namhala Eli ūhaya, “Ng'wana wane, natitanile ū nene shokaga ūkalaale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Sang'weli wal'ataalī ū kūūmana ū SEEBA, nguno wal'ataalī ū kūkundūlīlwa ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'witana ū Sang'weli lūkangala lwa kadatū; ū Sang'weli ūbūūka ūja ū kūlī Eli ūūkang'wīla, “Nalīho baba wanitana.” A henaho ū Eli witegeleja nose gīkī SEEBA alīng'witana ū nyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Eli ūng'wīla ū Sang'weli, “Jaga ūkalaale, ūlū alitane hangī ūkūshosha gīkī, ‘Yombaga SEEBA, ū ntūmami wako alīdegeleka.’” Ng'hana ū Sang'weli ūja ūūkalaala ha būlaalo wakwe wa shikū jose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango kūlwa numba ya ng'wa Eli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wiza wīmīīla witana gīt'ūmo wītīlaga ī ng'hangala ī jingī; ūhaya, “Sang'weli! Sang'weli.” Ū Sang'weli widīka ūhaya, “Yombaga ū ntūmami wako alīdegeleka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Managa gīkī nalī hihī kwīta mhayo ntaale ū mu Baisilaeli, ūyo būlī ng'wene ū wa kūgwigwa, a matū gakwe gakūding'himīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gakūding'himīla:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūbabīīla, kūsalalīla, kūzwangana. Lola na mu 2Ba 21:12; Yel 19:3.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ī kaya ya ng'wa Eli nakwīshikīlīgīja ū nsango gwayo kūlenganīla nī mihayo ī yose īyo nayīhaya kūfuma wandījo wayo kūshisha būkalīkījo wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nang'wīla gīkī ī kaya yakwe nakwīyinha nsango gwa weleelo, kūlwa būkenaagūji ūbo abūmanile; nguno a bitūnja bakwe bandalahile no ū SEEBA, alīyo ū wei alemeelilwe ū kūbahūgūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nīyilahīlīlile ī kaya ya ng'wa Eli gīkī, ‘Ū būbi wa numba ya ng'wa Eli būtīko kwīnjiwa mu nzīla ya shitambò nūūlū shakwinha shose shose īsho shilafunyiwe.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli wikala ha būlīīlī kūshisha dilū; aho wela wīlugūla ī milyango ya numba ya ng'wa SEEBA. Alīyo ogoha ū kūng'wīla ū Eli ī ya koolekegeje ka ng'wa SEEBA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ū Eli ūng'witana alīhaya, “Ng'wana wane Sang'weli!” Sang'weli nang'hwe widīka alīhaya, “Kalame baba, nalīho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eli ūng'wīla, “Walī wakūwīla mhayo kī? Ūtizūnibisa mhayo nūūlū gūmò. Ūlū ūlanibise mhayo nūūlū gūmò ū mu yose īyo wakūwīlaga ū Mulungu, akūkūtūla hataale na kūtinda ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla pyī ī yose, atamisile mhayo nūūlū gūmò. Nang'hwe ū Eli ūhaya, “Ū wei alī SEEBA, ni ītage ūyo alīgūbona gūlībeela mu miso gakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA walī hamò nū Sang'weli ū mu kakūlīle kakwe, atagūlekile ū mhayo gwakwe gūjimīīle sagala sagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo pye a Baisilaeli, kwandīja Dani kūshisha Beeli-sheba, būūdeeba gīkī ū Sang'weli walī ng'hangi nsolwa o ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ongeja kwiyoolecha ū kūlī Sang'weli ī Shilo, ū SEEBA wiyoolecha ū kūlī Sang'weli ū kwenūko mu nzīla ya mhayo gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
